      47.85,
      363.49,
      537.92,
      407.56
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this Orderimpose in respect of the list of commodity specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, a Special Commodity Levy atthe rate specified in the corresponding entries in Column II of the Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      418.45,
      537.84,
      440.56
    ],
    "text": "This order shall be valid for a period of 06 months commencing from January 04, 2019 subject to provisions of SubSection (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      451.45,
      537.85,
      484.6
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007 and published inthe Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2095/21 of 01.11.2018 in respect of Black gram is rescinded with effectfrom January 04, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
